From 4a532233dbdc63e97514233595508ba655e16748 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Fredrik=20S=C3=B6derquist?= <fs@opera.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Nov 2025 08:37:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [backport] Dependency for CVE-2026-121044

Move ParserModeOverridingScope optimization from SVGElement to CSSParser

Transform the local GetParserContext() helper function into a helper
class (LocalCSSParserContext) that performs the same setup. Move the
logic for setting up a ParserModeOverridingScope when the parser mode
does not match the one from the StyleSheetContents' parser context from
SVGElement::CustomStyleForLayoutObject into the helper class.

In preparation for eliminating custom-style callbacks on SVGElement.

Bug: 40550039
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7133393
Task-number: QTBUG-152028
Change-Id: Ic1480366ba50fecc5dba493ebc412e079751c2f5
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/786530
Reviewed-by: Allan Sandfeld Jensen <allan.jensen@qt.io>
---
